hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"22864","Abdur-Rahman ibn Mahdi narrated to us: Muawiyah narrated to us, from Yunus ibn Sayf, from al-Harith ibn Ghutayf, or Ghutayf ibn al-Harith, who said: Of things I have not forgotten, I have not forgotten that I saw the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, placing his right upon his left in prayer."
